icit country --\n\nChina is a proxy for obvious reasons to those who follow me\n\nA way to try to put the current rise in perspective\n\n1/2 https://t.co/FjKsGS5WsN https://t.co/RUwXJiibJC", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114373045850919297"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:49:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114368861042880517"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sQTh52d4X9", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114368861042880517/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114368812468588544", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/sQTh52d4X9"}]}, "id": "2114368861042880517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 21573, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Something a bit different --\n\nKorea and Taiwan's current account surplus (q3 is a projection/ q4 is a forecast based in q3) as a share of US GDP .... trying to capture visually how the AI buildout is flowing to the chip exporters.\n\n1/ https://t.co/sQTh52d4X9", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114368861042880517"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:47:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114353170189091075"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/business/statu…", "end": 37, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/business/status/2114160077485564302", "start": 14, "url": "https://t.co/ctTdNFBHV0"}]}, "id": "2114353170189091075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3725, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114160077485564302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Not stimulus! https://t.co/ctTdNFBHV0", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114353170189091075"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:05:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114342624614293506"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JdlvRSC